:0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The cause is the recent added test files in https://github.com/bokeh/bokeh/tree/master/bokeh/server/tests/data\n\nThis add 10 MB to our builds which represent 75% of the build (w/o this data it has arounf 3MB).\n\nSo, is there any possibility to get this data from somewhere else, maybe at installation time?\n\nOr other workaround? It would be nice to solve this issue before the release, but I suppose we can make 0.8.1 if we don't find a nice way to solve it.\n\n@hhuuggoo, but also @bokeh/core \n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokeh/bokeh/issues/1890/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bokeh/bokeh/issues/1890/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}